"Way of Kel Amroth"
"You are standing on the Way of Kel Amroth, just east of the desert city's main

gate.  Bright-colored cloths drape from nearby shops depicting a variety of

goods and services.  To the east is a bustling intersection, crawling with

merchants and crowds of people rummaging through the myriad shops and bazaars.

A gold-engraved @y@Yplaque@n hangs on the city wall to the south.

