a few chairs have been placed here by the city guard to act as a quiet place

to talk, as this corner of the city, while busy, does not boast the commercial

traffic of other parts of the city.  A small wooden ladder runs up the wall to

the south to a trapdoor.  The trapdoor leads into a house which hangs from the

wall.

